Route8_Text_SuperNerdTomIntro::
	.string "We can’t do without electricity.\p"
	.string "The POWER PLANT supplies us with\n"
	.string "electricity.$"

Route8_Text_SuperNerdTomDefeat::
	.string "Don’t waste electricity!$"

Route8_Text_SuperNerdTom::
	.string "The POWER PLANT north of LAVENDER\n"
	.string "supplies power to the MAGNET TRAIN.$"

Route8_Text_SuperNerdSamIntro::
	.string "How does the MAGNET TRAIN work?$"

Route8_Text_SuperNerdSamDefeat::
	.string "I just want to see the MAGNET TRAIN...$"

Route8_Text_SuperNerdSam::
	.string "The power of magnets is awesome!$"

Route8_Text_BikerDwayneIntro::
	.string "We’re the KANTO POKéMON FEDERATION\n"
	.string "trainer group.\p"
	.string "We’ll drive you under our wheels!$"

Route8_Text_BikerDwayneDefeat::
	.string "S-sorry!$"

Route8_Text_BikerDwayne::
	.string "The KANTO POKéMON FEDERATION will\n"
	.string "never fall!$"

Route8_Text_BikerHarrisIntro::
	.string "The cops shut down our UNDERGROUND\n"
	.string "PATH! That really fries me!$"

Route8_Text_BikerHarrisDefeat::
	.string "F-forgive me!$"

Route8_Text_BikerHarris::
	.string "Wiped out by some punk from JOHTO…$"

Route8_Text_BikerZekeIntro::
	.string "We’re the KANTO POKéMON FEDERA-\n"
	.string "TION!\l"
	.string "Right on, dude!$"

Route8_Text_BikerZekeDefeat::
	.string "Yikes! Sorry!$"

Route8_Text_BikerZeke::
	.string "We’ll try not to disturb anyone\n"
	.string "from now on...$"

Route8_Text_Sign2::
	.string "The flyer’s torn.\p"
	.string "It’s impossible to read...$"

Route8_Text_Sign3::
	.string "It’s locked...$"
